        "start_line": 30,
        "end_line": 39
      },
      "excerpt": "Description:\n\ntorch.add behaves inconsistently between CPU and CUDA when using float16 tensors with extremely large alpha values.\n\n\nCPU implementation raises overflow error.\n\nCUDA silently completes the operation.\n\n",
      "attribution": {
        "actor": null,
        "actor_role": "reporter"
      },
      "content_hash": "sha256:3cda98807e8c144210ec7b4281c4992ded62c3b58eee0f882d6e061ee6e25d21"
    },
    {
